      "id": "sol.amc-8-2013-p3.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Within the parentheses, pair consecutive terms: \\[ \\begin{aligned} &(-1+2)+(-3+4) \\\\ &\\quad {}+\\cdots+(-999+1000). \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nEach pair has sum \\(1\\), and there are \\(500\\) pairs, so the value inside the parentheses is \\(500\\). Multiplying by \\(4\\) gives \\(2000\\).\n\nThus, E is the correct answer.",
